==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|clad|ing|lang=en}}. Compare {{term|clothing|lang=en}}, ultimately from the same source.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ædɪŋ|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{context|rare|lang=en}} [[clothing|Clothing]]; [[clothes]].
# Any hard [[coating]], [[bonded]] onto the outside of something to add [[protection]], such as the [[plastic]] [[sheath]] around an [[optical fiber]].
# {{context|construction|lang=en}} a [[weatherproof]], [[insulating]] or [[decorative]] [[covering]] fixed to the outside of a [[building]] (called [[siding]] in the US).

